<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE TO CONSIDER VOUCHER, KLEMENTI LISTING.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TO CONSIDER VOUCHER, KLEMENTI LISTING.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange listing commission will on May 13 discuss the listing of privatisation vouchers (EVP) on the free market, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The commission will also discuss the listing of textile company Klementi on the secondary market and Eesti Naitused on the main list, Helo Meigas, bourse director told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
